{"pages":[{"segs":[["O N E-V E R S E E VA N G E L I S M 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,614.64890000000003,9,false],["ONE-VERSE",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,353.98000000000002,116.00059999999996,80,false],["EVANGELISM",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,382.77999999999997,176.00059999999996,80,false],["RANDY D. RAYSBROOK",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,358.25999999999999,194.10059999999999,20,false],["Many people feel that to be effective in evangelism",146.40000000000001,225.43489999999986,337.01100000000008,237.8368999999999,9,false],["they must memorize a complex illustration and a",146.40000000000001,238.43089999999984,331.30500000000018,250.83289999999988,9,false],["multitude of verses. But the Gospel is most powerful",146.40000000000001,251.42689999999982,344.11200000000008,263.82889999999986,9,false],["when shared with love, clarity, and simplicity.",146.40000000000001,264.4228999999998,319.1280000000001,276.82489999999984,9,false],["have lived our lives.",419.70299999999997,225.35389999999973,493.899,237.75589999999977,9,false],["sin",375.11200000000002,256.2367999999999,394.16800000000006,275.64479999999992,16,false],["One-Verse Evangelism is a simple, interactive way",146.40000000000001,290.42389999999989,336.95700000000011,302.82589999999988,9,false],["to share Christ’s love conversationally and visually.",146.40000000000001,303.41989999999987,339.61200000000008,315.82189999999986,9,false],["It is based on asking questions and sharing. It’s easy",146.40000000000001,316.41589999999985,342.10500000000008,328.81789999999984,9,false],["to learn because it uses just one verse. One-Verse",146.40000000000001,329.41189999999983,331.53899999999999,341.81389999999982,9,false],["Evangelism is also sensitive to peoples’ busy",146.40000000000001,342.40789999999981,314.11500000000001,354.8098999999998,9,false],["schedules because it can be shared in just 10 or 15",146.40000000000001,355.40389999999979,333.7170000000001,367.80589999999978,9,false],["minutes.",146.40000000000001,368.39989999999977,179.82600000000002,380.80189999999976,9,false],["death",365.75200000000001,412.02879999999999,404.53600000000006,431.43680000000001,16,false],["but",373.75200000000001,476.81279999999998,396.55200000000002,496.2208,16,false],["Draw a circle around “sin,” asking your",419.70299999999997,251.3548999999997,566.322,263.75689999999975,9,false],["friend what he thinks when he hears",419.70299999999997,264.35089999999968,557.51099999999997,276.75289999999973,9,false],["this word. You might explain that sin is",419.70299999999997,277.34689999999978,566.69100000000003,289.74889999999976,9,false],["more an attitude than an action. It can",419.70299999999997,290.34289999999976,564.24300000000005,302.74489999999975,9,false],["be either actively fighting God or merely",419.70299999999997,303.33889999999974,571.68599999999992,315.74089999999973,9,false],["excluding Him from our lives. You can",419.70299999999997,316.33489999999972,563.577,328.73689999999971,9,false],["ask, “Has God ever seemed far away?” If",419.70299999999997,329.3308999999997,570.52500000000009,341.73289999999969,9,false],["he says “Yes,” add that that’s one of the",419.70299999999997,342.32689999999968,564.86400000000003,354.72889999999967,9,false],["things sin does-it makes God seem far",419.70299999999997,355.32289999999966,563.25300000000016,367.72489999999965,9,false],["away. Now draw two opposing cliffs with",419.70299999999997,368.31889999999964,573.45000000000005,380.72089999999963,9,false],["a gap in between.",419.70299999999997,381.31489999999962,484.45799999999997,393.71689999999961,9,false],["Circle this word and ask what thoughts",419.70299999999997,407.3158999999996,567.60000000000002,419.71789999999959,9,false],["come to mind. Explain that death in",419.70299999999997,420.31189999999958,554.71199999999999,432.71389999999957,9,false],["the Bible always means some kind of",419.70299999999997,433.30789999999956,558.20399999999995,445.70989999999955,9,false],["separation.",419.70299999999997,446.30389999999954,462.38999999999999,458.70589999999953,9,false],["While circling this word, mention that",419.70299999999997,472.30489999999952,564.93600000000015,484.70689999999951,9,false],["it is important because it means that",419.70299999999997,485.3008999999995,558.14999999999998,497.70289999999949,9,false],["a sharp contrast in thought is coming.",419.70299999999997,498.29689999999948,562.21799999999996,510.69889999999947,9,false],["What we have just looked at is bad news;",419.70299999999997,511.29289999999946,572.61300000000006,523.69489999999951,9,false],["what follows is good news.",419.70299999999997,524.28889999999944,519.79200000000003,536.69089999999937,9,false],["Here’s a brief look at how it works. Let’s say God’s",146.40000000000001,524.39689999999973,333.05100000000004,536.79889999999978,9,false],["leading you to share the Gospel with your neighbor,",146.40000000000001,537.39289999999983,339.90900000000011,549.79489999999976,9,false],["Jeff. Write out Romans 6:23 on a piece of paper or a",146.40000000000001,550.38889999999981,339.86400000000015,562.79089999999974,9,false],["napkin: “For the wages of sin is death, but the gift of",146.40000000000001,563.38489999999979,340.97100000000012,575.78689999999983,9,false],["God is eternal life in Christ Jesus our Lord” (NIV).",146.40000000000001,576.38089999999988,337.596,588.78289999999981,9,false],["Then put your Bible away. Ask Jeff if he would like",146.40000000000001,589.37689999999975,336.15600000000006,601.77889999999979,9,false],["to see a simple picture based on this verse that will",146.40000000000001,602.37289999999985,337.64100000000008,614.77489999999989,9,false],["explain God’s relationship with people.",146.40000000000001,615.36889999999983,293.96400000000006,627.77089999999987,9,false],["wages",139.57140000000001,645.31150000000002,180.35540000000003,664.71950000000004,16,false],["Circle this word and ask, “How would",195.90000000000001,641.36989999999992,337.85700000000008,653.77189999999985,9,false],["you feel if your boss refused to pay you",195.90000000000001,654.36589999999978,340.99800000000005,666.76789999999983,9,false],["the wages that were due to you?” Deep",195.90000000000001,667.36189999999988,340.37700000000007,679.76389999999981,9,false],["down, we all know that it is only right",195.90000000000001,680.35789999999986,336.79500000000007,692.75989999999979,9,false],["that we get what we deserve. Similarly,",195.90000000000001,693.35389999999984,342.36600000000004,705.75589999999988,9,false],["we earn wages from God for how we",195.90000000000001,706.34989999999982,331.87200000000007,718.75189999999986,9,false],["gift",373.11200000000002,555.24479999999994,397.33600000000007,574.65279999999996,16,false],["Draw a circle around this word. Ask,",419.70299999999997,550.28989999999942,556.48500000000001,562.69189999999946,9,false],["“If wages are what a person earns, then",419.70299999999997,563.2858999999994,566.99700000000007,575.68789999999944,9,false],["what is a gift?” Remind your friend that",419.70299999999997,576.2818999999995,568.98599999999999,588.68389999999943,9,false],["someone must purchase every gift.",419.70299999999997,589.27789999999948,551.11200000000008,601.67989999999941,9,false],["of God",362.84000000000003,619.96479999999997,405.88000000000005,639.37279999999998,16,false],["Circle this and explain that the gift you",419.70299999999997,615.27889999999945,566.61000000000001,627.6808999999995,9,false],["are talking about is free. It is from God",419.70299999999997,628.27489999999943,564.76499999999999,640.67689999999948,9,false],["Himself. It’s so special that no one else",419.70299999999997,641.27089999999953,565.39499999999998,653.67289999999946,9,false],["can give it. Ask, “How do you feel when",419.70299999999997,654.26689999999951,566.38499999999999,666.66889999999944,9,false],["someone gives you a special gift?”",419.70299999999997,667.26289999999949,547.24199999999996,679.66489999999953,9,false],["continued . . .",419.70299999999997,706.25989999999945,467.86199999999997,718.67089999999951,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",192.9309998,764.7502197,419.06899980000003,778.53021969999998,10,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792},{"h":792,"segs":[["eternal life",147.75800000000001,38.244699999999966,203.90200000000004,57.524699999999939,16,false],["Circle these two words next, and then",215.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,357.69000000000005,45.836899999999901,9,false],["ask, “How would you define these",215.40000000000001,46.430899999999838,341.73300000000006,58.832899999999881,9,false],["words?” Contrast one side of the cliff,",215.40000000000001,59.426899999999819,356.54700000000003,71.828899999999862,9,false],["death, with the other side, eternal life.",215.40000000000001,72.4228999999998,358.65300000000008,84.824899999999843,9,false],["Ask, “What is the opposite of separation",215.40000000000001,85.41889999999978,367.02300000000002,97.820899999999824,9,false],["from God?”",215.40000000000001,98.414899999999761,259.12200000000001,110.81689999999981,9,false],["Christ Jesus",145.07000000000002,142.37270000000001,206.94200000000001,161.65269999999998,16,false],["Draw these words so they create a",215.40000000000001,137.41189999999972,343.49700000000007,149.81389999999976,9,false],["bridge between the two cliffs. Help your",215.40000000000001,150.4078999999997,365.61900000000009,162.80989999999974,9,false],["friend to consider that every gift has a",215.40000000000001,163.40389999999968,358.43700000000001,175.80589999999972,9,false],["giver, and only Jesus Christ can give the",215.40000000000001,176.39989999999966,366.07800000000009,188.8018999999997,9,false],["gift of eternal life.",215.40000000000001,189.39589999999964,282.666,201.79789999999969,9,false],["trust",161.03800000000001,232.27670000000001,190.20600000000002,251.55669999999998,16,false],["Write this word over the bridge you",215.40000000000001,228.3928999999996,349.16700000000009,240.79489999999964,9,false],["just drew. Explain that friends trust",215.40000000000001,241.38889999999958,350.59800000000001,253.79089999999962,9,false],["each other, and tell your friend that",215.40000000000001,254.38489999999956,348.54600000000005,266.7868999999996,9,false],["Jesus wants a trusting friendship with",215.40000000000001,267.38089999999954,361.11000000000001,279.78289999999959,9,false],["him. All he has to do is admit that he",215.40000000000001,280.37689999999964,351.92100000000005,292.77889999999962,9,false],["is responsible for the “sin” of either",215.40000000000001,293.37289999999962,349.12200000000007,305.7748999999996,9,false],["fighting or excluding God from his life.",215.40000000000001,306.3688999999996,360.52500000000009,318.77089999999959,9,false],["That is what trust means-trusting that",215.40000000000001,319.36489999999958,361.49700000000001,331.76689999999957,9,false],["Jesus wants to forgive us for rejecting",215.40000000000001,332.36089999999956,358.51800000000003,344.76289999999955,9,false],["Him from our lives. At this point,",215.40000000000001,345.35689999999954,339.92400000000004,357.75889999999953,9,false],["you can ask him if he wants to start",215.40000000000001,358.35289999999952,347.97900000000004,370.75489999999951,9,false],["a relationship with God that will last",215.40000000000001,371.3488999999995,353.72100000000006,383.75089999999949,9,false],["forever. If he says “Yes,” invite him to",215.40000000000001,384.34489999999948,355.06200000000007,396.74689999999947,9,false],["pray a short prayer in his own words,",215.40000000000001,397.34089999999946,354.40500000000009,409.74289999999945,9,false],["asking Jesus to forgive him.",215.40000000000001,410.33689999999945,320.178,422.73889999999943,9,false],["Close by reminding them that this simple illustration",161.40000000000001,436.33789999999942,362.63100000000003,448.73989999999941,9,false],["shows what God is like: Someone who really cares",161.40000000000001,449.3338999999994,350.03100000000006,461.73589999999939,9,false],["about people, especially them. Invite them to read all",161.40000000000001,462.32989999999938,360.60599999999999,474.73189999999937,9,false],["about it in the Bible, perhaps beginning in the gospel",161.40000000000001,475.32589999999936,359.28300000000013,487.72789999999935,9,false],["of John.",161.40000000000001,488.32189999999935,191.99100000000001,500.72389999999933,9,false],["O N E-V E R S E",43.841200000000001,572.9579,57.071200000000005,615.44090000000006,7,false],["E VA N G E L I S M 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,569.98289999999997,9,false],["Adapted with permission from One-Verse Evangelism,",161.40000000000001,644.3188999999993,363.32400000000007,656.72989999999936,9,false],["copyright 2000 Randy D. Raysbrook. All rights",161.40000000000001,657.3148999999994,334.83900000000006,669.72589999999934,9,false],["reserved. You may order this booklet from NavPress, or",161.40000000000001,670.31089999999938,364.34099999999989,682.72189999999932,9,false],["call (800) 366-7788.",161.40000000000001,683.30689999999936,236.64000000000001,695.7178999999993,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",192.9309998,764.7502197,419.06899980000003,778.53021969999998,10,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612}]}